

LogicBBS test install.
======================



To make a quick and simple test install, for easy startup.

Copy the file from the {S} directory found in the "lha" archive,
into your own S: directory. File is called "BBS1.PREFS"

Assign "BBS:" to {LhA unpacked archive path}LogicBBS
ie.
Assign BBS: HD0:UNPACKED/LOGICBBS
Assign DOORS: BBS:DOORS

If you wish to use a different path than BBS:, just modify the
"BBS1.PREFS" file and search for "BBS" in the prefs file, change
path to what you may prefer, and save file.

Then run the LogicBBS program from Workbench located in the LogicBBS drawer.




